<p id="mwAtc">This was the third playoff meeting between these two teams, but the first since the New Jersey Nets <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_Brooklyn_Nets" title="History of the Brooklyn Nets" id="mwAtg">relocated to Brooklyn</a> and became the Brooklyn Nets in 2012, with the Nets winning the first two meetings. After Game 4, a Celtics fan was arrested for throwing a water bottle at <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyrie_Irving" title="Kyrie Irving" id="mwAtk">Kyrie Irving</a> which nearly struck him.<sup about="#mwt152" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-34" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-34"}}'><a href="#cite_note-34" id="mwAto"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAts"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAtw">[</span>34<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAt0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

