</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div>

<p id="mwAu8">The Bucks erupted for 46 points in the first quarter, setting a new franchise playoff record, en route to a dominating 132–98 victory. The Bucks would make 22 three-pointers, after making only 5 in game 1.</p>
