</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div>

<p id="mwAvI">The Bucks would cruise to another convincing victory in game 3, to take a commanding 3–0 series lead on Miami. In games 2 &amp; 3, the Heat led for only 17 seconds, out of 96 minutes of game time.</p>
