<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_Airlines_Arena" title="American Airlines Arena" class="mw-redirect">American Airlines Arena</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miami" title="Miami">Miami, FL</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 17,000<br/><b>Referees:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Zarba" title="Zach Zarba">Zach Zarba</a>, James Williams, Karl Lane</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div>
<p id="mwAvU">Though Miami built a 7-point lead at halftime, the Bucks went on a 24–6 run in the third quarter to take a lead they would not relinquish, leading to a four-game sweep of the Heat.</p>
