<p id="mwA1Y">This was the first playoff meeting between the Jazz and the Grizzlies.<sup about="#mwt190" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-37" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-37"}}'><a href="#cite_note-37" id="mwA1c"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA1g"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA1k">[</span>37<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA1o">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

