<p id="mwA3U">This was the 13th playoff meeting between these two teams, with the Lakers winning eight of the first 12 meetings.<sup about="#mwt202" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-38" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-38"}}'><a href="#cite_note-38" id="mwA3Y"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA3c"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA3g">[</span>38<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA3k">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

