<p id="mwA-I">This was the second playoff meeting between these two teams, with the Clippers winning the first meeting.<sup about="#mwt242" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-40" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-40"}}'><a href="#cite_note-40" id="mwA-M"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwA-Q"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-U">[</span>40<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwA-Y">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

