<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_Farm_Arena" title="State Farm Arena">State Farm Arena</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlanta" title="Atlanta">Atlanta, GA</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 16,432<br/><b>Referees:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zach_Zarba" title="Zach Zarba">Zach Zarba</a>, Kevin Scott, Courtney Kirkland</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div><p id="mwBAM">The 76ers cruised their way to victory throughout the entire game thanks in part to Joel Embiid's 27 points, 9 rebounds, and 8 assists.

Trae Young scored 28 points and 8 assists in the losing effort for the Hawks.</p><div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt247" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBAQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Basketballbox","href":"./Template:Basketballbox"},"params":{"date":{"wt":"June 14"},"time":{"wt":"7:30pm"},"place":{"wt":"[[State Farm Arena]], [[Atlanta|Atlanta, GA]]"},"TV":{"wt":"[[NBA on TNT|TNT]]"},"team1":{"wt":"[[Philadelphia 76ers]]"},"score1":{"wt":"100"},"team2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;[[Atlanta Hawks]]&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"score2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;103&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"report":{"wt":"[https://www.nba.com/game/phi-vs-atl-0042000204 Recap]"},"Q1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;28&apos;&apos;&apos;–20"},"Q2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;34&apos;&apos;&apos;–29"},"Q3":{"wt":"20–&apos;&apos;&apos;31&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q4":{"wt":"18–&apos;&apos;&apos;23&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"points1":{"wt":"[[Tobias Harris]] 20"},"points2":{"wt":"[[Trae Young]] 25"},"rebounds1":{"wt":"[[Joel Embiid]] 21"},"rebounds2":{"wt":"[[Clint Capela]] 13"},"assist1":{"wt":"[[Ben Simmons]] 9"},"assist2":{"wt":"Trae Young 18"},"attendance":{"wt":"16,502"},"referee":{"wt":"John Goble, Josh Tiven, [[Curtis Blair]]"},"series":{"wt":"Series tied, 2–2"}},"i":0}}]}'></div><div style="width: 100%; " about="#mwt247" id="mwBAU">
