</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%"><td style="text-align:center; border-style:none" colspan="3"><b>Scoring by quarter:</b> <b>28</b>–20, <b>34</b>–29, 20–<b>31</b>, 18–<b>23</b></td></tr><tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%">
<td style="width:48%; text-align:right; border-style:none"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_(basketball)" title="Point (basketball)" class="mw-redirect">Pts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobias_Harris" title="Tobias Harris">Tobias Harris</a> 20<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebound_(basketball)" title="Rebound (basketball)">Rebs</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joel_Embiid" title="Joel Embiid">Joel Embiid</a> 21<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assist_(basketball)" title="Assist (basketball)">Asts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Simmons" title="Ben Simmons">Ben Simmons</a> 9</td>
<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trae_Young" title="Trae Young">Trae Young</a> 25<br/><b>Rebs:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clint_Capela" title="Clint Capela">Clint Capela</a> 13<br/><b>Asts:</b> Trae Young 18</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Series tied, 2–2</b></i></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table style=" float:right; width:24%; table-layout:fixed">
<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_Farm_Arena" title="State Farm Arena">State Farm Arena</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlanta" title="Atlanta">Atlanta, GA</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 16,502<br/><b>Referees:</b> John Goble, Josh Tiven, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curtis_Blair" title="Curtis Blair">Curtis Blair</a></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div><p id="mwBAY">Despite being down by 18, the Atlanta Hawks staged a comeback, eventually taking their first lead since the 1st quarter at the start of the 4th quarter. The 76ers were up by 4 with 2:20 left in the 4th quarter, but the Hawks responded with a 7–0 run, leading by 3 with 49.6 seconds left. After Embiid got fouled and made both free throws to make it 101–100, and a turnover by John Collins, the 76ers had a chance at leading the series 3 games to 1. Embiid's go-ahead shot fell short and the ball went out of bounds, last touched by Ben Simmons, giving Atlanta the ball with 8.2 seconds left.

After Trae Young made both of his free throws to make it a 3-point game, the 76ers had 6.6 seconds left to tie it, but Seth Curry's game-tying 3-pointer was no good, giving Atlanta the comeback victory.</p><div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt248" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBAc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Basketballbox","href":"./Template:Basketballbox"},"params":{"bg":{"wt":"#eee"},"date":{"wt":"June 16"},"time":{"wt":"7:30pm"},"place":{"wt":"[[Wells Fargo Center (Philadelphia)|Wells Fargo Center]], [[Philadelphia|Philadelphia, PA]]"},"TV":{"wt":"[[NBA on TNT|TNT]]"},"team1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;[[Atlanta Hawks]]&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"score1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;109&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"team2":{"wt":"[[Philadelphia 76ers]]"},"score2":{"wt":"106"},"report":{"wt":"[https://www.nba.com/game/atl-vs-phi-0042000205 Recap]"},"Q1":{"wt":"24–&apos;&apos;&apos;38&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q2":{"wt":"16–&apos;&apos;&apos;24&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;29&apos;&apos;&apos;–25"},"Q4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;40&apos;&apos;&apos;–19"},"points1":{"wt":"[[Trae Young]] 39"},"points2":{"wt":"[[Joel Embiid]] 37"},"rebounds1":{"wt":"[[John Collins (basketball)|John Collins]] 11"},"rebounds2":{"wt":"Joel Embiid 13"},"assist1":{"wt":"Trae Young 7"},"assist2":{"wt":"[[Ben Simmons]] 9"},"attendance":{"wt":"18,624"},"referee":{"wt":"David Guthrie, Eric Lewis, [[Bill Kennedy (referee)|Bill Kennedy]]"},"series":{"wt":"Atlanta leads series, 3–2"}},"i":0}}]}'></div><div style="width: 100%; background-color:#eee; color:#202122;" about="#mwt248" id="mwBAg">
