</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%"><td style="text-align:center; border-style:none" colspan="3"><b>Scoring by quarter:</b> 22–<b>29</b>, <b>25</b>–22, <b>33</b>–25, <b>24</b>–23</td></tr><tr style="vertical-align:top; font-size:85%">
<td style="width:48%; text-align:right; border-style:none"><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_(basketball)" title="Point (basketball)" class="mw-redirect">Pts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seth_Curry" title="Seth Curry">Curry</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobias_Harris" title="Tobias Harris">Harris</a> 24 each<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebound_(basketball)" title="Rebound (basketball)">Rebs</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joel_Embiid" title="Joel Embiid">Joel Embiid</a> 13<br/><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assist_(basketball)" title="Assist (basketball)">Asts</a>:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Simmons" title="Ben Simmons">Ben Simmons</a> 5</td>
<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trae_Young" title="Trae Young">Trae Young</a> 34<br/><b>Rebs:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clint_Capela" title="Clint Capela">Capela</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kevin_Huerter" title="Kevin Huerter">Huerter</a> 11 each<br/><b>Asts:</b> Trae Young 12</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Series tied, 3–3</b></i></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<table style=" float:right; width:24%; table-layout:fixed">
<tbody><tr><td style="border-style:none"><div style="font-size:85%"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/State_Farm_Arena" title="State Farm Arena">State Farm Arena</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atlanta" title="Atlanta">Atlanta, GA</a><br/><b>Attendance:</b> 16,610<br/><b>Referees:</b> Scott Foster, Pat Fraher, James Williams</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table><div style="clear:both"></div></div><p id="mwBBU">With the Hawks looking to advance to the Eastern Conference finals on their home floor, they led by as much as 12 points during the 2nd quarter.  But the 76ers, who were trying to stave off elimination after back-to-back collapses, managed to take control of the game.

However, the game once again would go down to the wire, as the Sixers were up 94–87 with 3 minutes left. The Hawks responded with 2 three-pointers from Gallinari and Young, who cut the deficit to one with 1:59 left in the 4th quarter.  The lights at State Farm Arena went out, causing a one-minute delay. Once the lights came back on, Philadelphia immediately responded by preserving the lead as Tobias Harris would make 2 game-sealing free throws to send the series back to Philadelphia for Game 7 on Sunday night.</p><div style="clear:both;" class="" about="#mwt251" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBBY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Basketballbox","href":"./Template:Basketballbox"},"params":{"bg":{"wt":"#eee"},"date":{"wt":"June 20"},"time":{"wt":"8:00pm"},"place":{"wt":"[[Wells Fargo Center (Philadelphia)|Wells Fargo Center]], [[Philadelphia|Philadelphia, PA]]"},"TV":{"wt":"[[NBA on TNT|TNT]]"},"team1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;[[Atlanta Hawks]]&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"score1":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;103&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"team2":{"wt":"[[Philadelphia 76ers]]"},"score2":{"wt":"96"},"report":{"wt":"[https://www.nba.com/game/atl-vs-phi-0042000207 Recap]"},"Q1":{"wt":"25–&apos;&apos;&apos;28&apos;&apos;&apos;"},"Q2":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;23&apos;&apos;&apos;–18"},"Q3":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;28&apos;&apos;&apos;–25"},"Q4":{"wt":"&apos;&apos;&apos;27&apos;&apos;&apos;–25"},"points1":{"wt":"[[Kevin Huerter]] 27"},"points2":{"wt":"[[Joel Embiid]] 31"},"rebounds1":{"wt":"[[John Collins (basketball)|John Collins]] 16"},"rebounds2":{"wt":"[[Tobias Harris]] 14"},"assist1":{"wt":"[[Trae Young]] 10"},"assist2":{"wt":"[[Ben Simmons]] 13"},"attendance":{"wt":"18,624"},"referee":{"wt":"James Capers, Kane Fitzgerald, Sean Wright"},"series":{"wt":"Atlanta wins series, 4–3"}},"i":0}}]}'></div><div style="width: 100%; background-color:#eee; color:#202122;" about="#mwt251" id="mwBBc">
