<p id="mwBDA">This was the third playoff meeting between these two teams, with the 76ers winning both previous meetings.<sup about="#mwt257" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-42" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-42"}}'><a href="#cite_note-42" id="mwBDE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBDI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDM">[</span>42<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBDQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

