<p id="mwBGI">This was the fourth playoff meeting between these two teams, but the first since the New Jersey Nets <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_Brooklyn_Nets" title="History of the Brooklyn Nets" id="mwBGM">relocated to Brooklyn</a> and became the Brooklyn Nets in 2012, with the Bucks winning two of the first three meetings.<sup about="#mwt272" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-43" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-43"}}'><a href="#cite_note-43" id="mwBGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBGU"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGY">[</span>43<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBGc">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

