<p id="mwBPs">This was the fifth playoff meeting between these two teams, with each team winning two series apiece.<sup about="#mwt320" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-47" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-47"}}'><a href="#cite_note-47" id="mwBPw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBP0"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBP4">[</span>47<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBP8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

