<td></td>
<td style="width:48%; text-align:left; border-style:none"><b>Pts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marcus_Morris" title="Marcus Morris" class="mw-redirect">Marcus Morris</a> 26<br/><b>Rebs:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_George" title="Paul George">George</a>, Morris 9 each<br/><b>Asts:</b> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reggie_Jackson_(basketball,_born_1990)" title="Reggie Jackson (basketball, born 1990)">Reggie Jackson</a> 8</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="text-align:center; border-style:none"><i><b>Phoenix wins series, 4–2</b></i></td></tr>
