<p id="mwBT8">This was the second playoff meeting between these two teams, with the Suns winning the previous meeting.<sup about="#mwt336" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-48" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-48"}}'><a href="#cite_note-48" id="mwBUA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBUE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBUI">[</span>48<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBUM">]</span></span></a></sup></p> 
